# Copy effects apply in layer 1 and control-changing effects in layer 2 (CR 613.1a-b): Bot2's Clone enters as a copy of
# Bot1's Lord of Atlantis, and each Lord gives the other +1/+1 and islandwalk ("other Merfolk", whoever controls them), so
# both are 3/3. Bot1 then takes the Clone with Mind Control: it is still a Lord of Atlantis, now Bot1's, and its ability,
# which never asked who controls what, still pumps the other Lord - both stay 3/3 with islandwalk.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Island
Lord of Atlantis
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Island
Mind Control
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Island
Clone
Island x15

